<title>USA: Emisphere Tech heparin oral delivery safe.</title>
<headline>Emisphere Tech heparin oral delivery safe.</headline>
<dateline>HAWTHORNE, N.Y. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emisphere Tech Inc and Elan Corp said Thursday clinical testing of the herapin oral delivery using one of Emisphere's proprietary carriers had shown that the product was safe.  </p>
<p>The companies said the testing also showed that administering the compound orally delivered sufficient amounts of it into the body.</p>
<p>Up until now, the only way to administer herapin, a compound used for cardiovascular ailments, has been by injection.</p>
<p>The companies are in a joint venture to develop a herapin product that can be given orally.</p>
<p>	  -- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
